    "Exchange program: Admission and Enrolment - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nGo to content\nGo to search\nGo to menu\nExchange program - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nShare\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nSend by Mail\nYour name\n*\nYour mail\n*\nRecipient(s)\n*\nSeparated by coma\nMessage\nImage's text\n*\nIf the image is not clear enough, you can refresh the page.\nExchange program: Admission and Enrolment\nInternational exchange students: you are coming to Bordeaux Montaigne University as part of a partnership agreement with your home university.\nIf you have any questions regarding your application to Bordeaux Montaigne University, please contact the International Relations Department, Student Mobility Office: incomingstudents@u-bordeaux-montaigne.fr\nThe Incoming Mobility team\nwill welcome international students during the following hours:\n\"Accueil Building\", second floor, room ACC207.\n- Monday to Thursday: from 1:30pm to 4:30pm\n- Friday: from 9am to 12pm\nfooter-script"
  ],
